Subject: Optimize-Chunk-Load-Pipeline

Author: VeltisMC Development Team
Date: 2026-06-19

Reason:
Vanilla chunk loading processes chunks sequentially within a level,
with limited parallelism between load, generate, and send phases.
This creates a bottleneck where chunk generation blocks loading and
vice versa. Moonrise's chunk system provides a parallel pipeline
that separates these concerns into dedicated thread pools.

Impact:
Significant reduction in world load times. Players see chunks appear
faster when moving through ungenerated terrain. Reduced main-thread
stall during chunk operations.

Migration Note:
This patch activates Moonrise's chunk load pipeline by wiring
VeltisPlatformHooks configuration values into the chunk system.
The actual pipeline changes are in moonrise mixins under
chunk_system.* (ServerChunkCacheMixin, ChunkHolderMixin, etc.).

